| Component | Token Variable | State | Type | Remapped by custom-theme-colors? |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **button** | `--instui-component-base-button-secondary-background` | default | Component-level | **YES** — contains literal navy hex |
| **button** | `--instui-component-base-button-secondary-hover-background` | :hover | Component-level | **YES** — flattened brand hex |
| **button** | `--instui-component-base-button-secondary-active-background` | :active | Component-level | **YES** — flattened brand hex |
| **button** | `--instui-component-base-button-secondary-disabled-background-color` | :disabled | Component-level | **YES** — flattened brand hex |
| **toggle-details** | `--instui-component-toggle-details-text-color` | — | Component-level | **YES** — downstream of brand |
| **toggle-details** | `--instui-color-background-interactive-action-secondary-base` | -variant-filled | Interactive action | **YES** — literal navy hex |
| **toggle-group** | `--instui-component-toggle-group-border-color` | — | Component-level | **YES** — likely navy brand |
| **toggle-group** | `--instui-color-background-elevated-surface-base` | — | Neutral surface | **NO** — not a brand family token |
| **toggle-group** | `--instui-component-toggle-details-text-color` | — | Component-level | **YES** — downstream of brand |

